--- QA attribution note (NEARS-1035 run, 2026-07-10) ---
Reproduced deterministically on BOTH the NEARS-1035 build (021d2028) AND base (7cf8783c,
verified by hot-restarting base flash_sale/ files): entering /flash-sale-details-screen from the
module-home rail throws "setState() or markNeedsBuild() called during build" (controller line
~101: sync update() inside getFlashSaleWithId(reload=true) called from initState while the
module-home rail's GetBuilder<FlashSaleController> is live). The throw aborts the async fn
BEFORE the network call -> /api/v1/flash-sales/items is NEVER requested -> details grid stuck
on shimmer forever from this nav path. PRE-EXISTING (introduced with NEARS-766 reload=true),
NOT caused by NEARS-1035. Widget tests pass because their harness has no second live
GetBuilder. Suggested fix direction: defer the reload-clear update() past the build phase
(e.g. schedule post-frame) or guard on SchedulerBinding phase.
